'''Maddox the Slayer''' is an [[NPC]] located at the {{Zone|Tavern}} basement. The player can participate in a [[Slayer]] quest after speaking to '''Maddox the Slayer''' and paying {{Coins}}. The player can access '''Maddox the Slayer''' from anywhere by using the {{Item|Maddox Batphone}} once reaching {{CollectionLink|Wolf Slayer III}}.

