== Trivia ==
*Maddox is [[Aatrox]]'s older brother. Aatrox's bonuses when [[Mayor Election|Mayor]] are each intended to improve slayers.
**In the original [https://hypixel.net/threads/3287083/ patch notes for the 0.9 update], Aatrox is referred to as {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer}}'s brother-in-law.
*A {{Green|5%}} discount for [[Slayer]] quests was originally planned from the [[City Project/Bartender's Brewery|Bartender's Brewery]] City Project, but this was changed to be {{Green|4%}} for all players if they reached level 7 on all slayer bosses, and an additional {{Green|1%}} if a player completed all the bonuses for the Bartender's Brewery City Project.
*'''Maddox''' and his brother [[Aatrox]] are from both from [[Scarleton]], on the [[Crimson Isle]].
*'''Maddox''' is referred to by {{NPCSprite|Tal Ker}} as "'''Crappox'''", 

